{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q761111","formula":"C₇H₅NO","hill":"C7H5NO","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":7.0,"H":5.0,"N":1.0,"O":1.0},"names":{"en":"Benzoxazole","ru":"Бензоксазол"},"descriptions":{"en":"Benzoxazole is an aromatic organic compound with a molecular formula C7H5NO, a benzene-fused oxazole ring structure, and an odor similar to pyridine. Although benzoxazole itself is of little practical value, many derivatives of benzoxazoles are commercially important. Being a heterocyclic compound, benzoxazole finds use in research as a starting material for the synthesis of larger, usually bioactive structures.","ru":"Бензоксазол — гетероциклическое органическое соединение с химической формулой C7H5NO, бесцветное кристаллическое вещество. Применяется в химической промышленности и для исследовательских целей. Используется для синтеза биологически-активных веществ."},"fame":20,"pubchemCid":9228,"mass":119.12,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=CC=C2C(=C1)N=CO2","inchikey":"BCMCBBGGLRIHSE-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"1,3-benzoxazole","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"9228","atoms":14,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-1.532,"y":-1.155,"z":0.0,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.624,"y":1.109,"z":0.0,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.252,"y":-0.682,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.311,"y":0.704,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.923,"y":-1.424,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.886,"y":1.433,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":2.109,"y":-0.681,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":2.093,"y":0.72,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.291,"y":-0.024,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.925,"y":-2.507,"z":0.0,"el":"H"},{"x":0.886,"y":2.518,"z":0.0,"el":"H"},{"x":3.063,"y":-1.202,"z":0.0,"el":"H"},{"x":3.034,"y":1.264,"z":0.0,"el":"H"},{"x":-3.362,"y":-0.164,"z":0.0,"el":"H"}],"bonds":[[0,2,1],[0,8,1],[1,3,1],[1,8,2],[2,3,1],[2,4,2],[3,5,2],[4,6,1],[4,9,1],[5,7,1],[5,10,1]